{
  "_README": [
    "The Measurement_Slice (testbench-failure-reportability): does the Check_Report_Rule move",
    "the Valueless_Report_Rate off its 55.2% Pinned_Baseline?",
    "76 slots: 4 Model_Arms x 19 Campaign_Designs x 1 sample, CONTROL ARM ONLY.",
    "Control only because the defect is a Control 57.3% / Grounded 53.0% split, so one arm",
    "answers the question and the other costs 76 more slots to answer it twice.",
    "Every arm's seed, temperature, caps, limits, and modelHost are copied from",
    "sweep.config.grounding-confirmatory-v1.json field for field (Req 8.5).",
    "This is the ONLY paid run of this spec. The baseline and the Replay_Gate are free.",
    "With no Campaign block declared, there is no maxResumes, so nextCampaignPass is never",
    "consulted and campaignPass records null; the kill switch's 8-slot headroom covers a",
    "deferred tail instead of a pass counter.",
    "Start it with `npm run eval:reportability-slice`, which runs the prompt-version,",
    "RTL-isolation, and fixture pins first and only then the sweep CLI."
